00:07:11.597 --> 00:07:13.465
"You know, it's
not going to be so bad.

00:07:13.465 --> 00:07:14.733
It's going to be like the flu."

00:07:14.733 --> 00:07:16.368
Or I should say,
"It's going to be like

00:07:16.368 --> 00:07:18.770
what we call the flu."

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:22.175
And now that his White House is
projecting as many as 100,000

00:07:22.175 --> 00:07:24.943
to 200,000 deaths
from the coronavirus,

00:07:24.943 --> 00:07:27.412
Trump has once again
shifted his tone.

00:07:27.412 --> 00:07:30.148
-I've had many friends,
businesspeople,

00:07:30.148 --> 00:07:32.117
