00:07:41.327 --> 00:07:44.197
But it's not the flu.
It's vicious.

00:07:44.197 --> 00:07:46.499
-You're the one who said
it was the flu.

00:07:46.499 --> 00:07:49.334
Those friends of yours were you.

00:07:49.334 --> 00:07:51.170
