00:07:55.574 --> 00:07:57.275
"And they all told me
this is just like the flu.

00:07:57.275 --> 00:07:59.544
Silly Trump even said it with
an old-timey car horn.

00:07:59.544 --> 00:08:00.879
[ Horn honks ]
[ Laughs ]

00:08:00.879 --> 00:08:03.883
Oh, Silly Trump,
you're incorrigible."

00:08:03.883 --> 00:08:08.086
And then Trump tried to claim
that despite repeatedly

00:08:08.086 --> 00:08:09.521
ignoring the problem,

00:08:09.521 --> 00:08:11.890
failing to surge
